"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_N_E=self.webpackChunk_N_E||[]).push([[18273],{18273:function(e){e.exports=JSON.parse('{"content":"\\n<center>\\n<BookCard \\n          cover=\\"/assets/snippets/books/white-light.png\\"\\n          title=\\"White Light\\"\\n          author=\\"Renjo Mikihiko\\"\\n          publisher=\\"Momo\\"\\n          publishedDate=\\"2022-02-14\\"\\n          isbn=\\"9791191043617\\"\\n          rating=4\\n          tags=\\"mystery\\"\\n        />\\n</center>\\n\\n## Review\\nThe body of a four-year-old girl is found, and her family along with a stranger become suspects.  \\nEven though the child was murdered, they are more concerned with denying their own charges than grieving.  \\n<br>\\nThe culprit changes every time the suspects are investigated.  \\nAfter finishing this book, I felt like I had watched the show <mark>Crime Scene</mark>.  \\n<br>\\nIt\'s a typical trick and culprit hunt, but the content is meticulous and has many elements of twists, so I enjoyed it.  \\nIt\'s the kind of book that reads easily and quickly because you\'re curious about the whole story.  \\nI felt once again that a character diagram is important for books like this."}')}}]);